               <p xml:id="idm227">Hartmann wrote the funeral march for the interment of Adam Oehlenschläger on 26. January 1850. It was repeated at the memorial performance at The Royal Theatre on 6 February, for which purpose Hartmann had added woodwinds, strings and timpani.</p>
